==Trivia==
* Kilthane's summoning commands are "'''Fight for your lady'''," "'''Quickly'''," "'''Seize the moment'''," and "'''Kilthane, your lady calls'''."
* His summoning command makes reference to the chivalry of Kilthane as a loyal black knight.
* Kilthane's design incorporates aspects resembling the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stag_beetle stag beetle], a family of scarab beetles.
